= 0. 5 \times (1 8 0 / 0. 5 1 0) ^ {3} \times 9 6 4 8 5 / (6. 0 2 2 \times 1 0 ^ {2 3})\tag{1 分}
$$

$$
= 3. 5 2 \times 1 0 ^ {- 1 2} (\mathrm{C})\tag{1 分}
$$

